@startuml
title Detailed Sequence Diagram: UC-06 View Owner Dashboard
autonumber
skinparam maxMessageSize 150

actor "Owner" as Own
participant "WebDashboard\n<<React>>" as Web
participant "DashboardController\n<<Node.js API>>" as API
database "MySQL\n<<Database>>" as DB

Own -> Web: Access Global Dashboard
activate Web

Web -> API: GET /api/owner/dashboard
activate API

par Concurrent Global Queries
    API -> DB: SELECT SUM(PlannedQty * Rate) AS Budget, SUM(Qty * Rate) AS Cost FROM Tasks JOIN TaskProgress
    activate DB
    DB --> API: return globalFinancials
    deactivate DB
    
    API -> DB: SELECT ProjectID, Name, Status, EndDate FROM Projects
    activate DB
    DB --> API: return projectStatuses
    deactivate DB
end

API -> API: Aggregate data & identify delays / budget overruns
API --> Web: HTTP 200 OK (ownerDashboardJSON)
deactivate API

Web --> Own: Render Multi-Project Dashboard & Alerts
deactivate Web

@enduml